    },
    {
      "id": "NAV537-02",
      "status": "verified-static",
      "conclusion": "The ordinary task cell forwards through the separately installed showCodexThread closure. Button callback 4399c8 tails 39e830. After disabled/selection gates, its non-search branch invokes instance +1f0. Constructor 396acc installs 42e0dc at exactly that slot. The closure forwards selected row to 34b39c and passes CodexTaskList.isSidebar from metadata +0x24.",
