    {
      "id": "NAV537-04",
      "status": "verified-static-with-parent-link-limit",
      "conclusion": "NavigationDestination metadata explicitly contains codexRemoteNewThread and codexRemoteThread. The high-bit payload used by selection matches the high-bit branch of the previously registered HomeNavigationRoot destination builder303aec. v536 establishes that branch constructs the Thread root and passes the shared ordinary MessageInputStyle. The exact complete CodexNavigationView path-binding-to-HomeRoot construction still requires one owner closure edge.",
